{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10A #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">2024 AMC 12A #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡️_1_min_solve_⚡️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_MaffyTaffy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by MaffyTaffy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the least value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74eac9e94d283cd73f2e42dcab5d199da3da30da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 11\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 21\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 22\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 23\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 253$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"410\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c1b00d66ef6058e723e353d136ceb26812427b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024=2^3\\cdot11\\cdot23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" /> in the prime factorization. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8c4136a7579ede76784794b85df3951c9170c6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23!$\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/08413538351fbea8d783f9a26968dfb8fc0694cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3, 11,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8dbbcd8a4752a4b9e89416dfdb33771abd8886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8c4136a7579ede76784794b85df3951c9170c6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23!$\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1f3095d791c8bd29bfb15d173e7d38148ea25fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/099cf9a98c5956a3dc96d78d3c8170a537d50fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 23}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><u><b>Remark</b></u>\n</p><p>Memorizing the prime factorization of the current year is useful for the AMC 8/10/12 Exams.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p><p><u><b>Remark</b></u>\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da8a735eacb81fe33127b139cb6f40b7b86eaaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025 -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a77e52d32af0df0d1d2c639c7a6a5c88543612ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45^2 -1 = (45+1)(45-1) = 46\\cdot44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"284\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>~WISETIGERJ2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3lsIwrVExBw\">https://youtu.be/3lsIwrVExBw</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Hc5DxRT-DOU\">https://youtu.be/Hc5DxRT-DOU</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math from my desk\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fAitluI5SoY&amp;t=3s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fAitluI5SoY&amp;t=3s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F_1_min_solve_.E2.9A.A1.EF.B8.8F.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡️_1_min_solve_⚡️)\">Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡️ 1 min solve ⚡️)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FD6rV3wGQ74\">https://youtu.be/FD6rV3wGQ74</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GPoTfGAf8bc?si=JYDhLVzfHUbXa3DW\">https://youtu.be/GPoTfGAf8bc?si=JYDhLVzfHUbXa3DW</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DXDJUCVX3yU\">https://youtu.be/DXDJUCVX3yU</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j-37jvqzhrg?si=qwyiAvKLbySyDR7D&amp;t=529\">https://youtu.be/j-37jvqzhrg?si=qwyiAvKLbySyDR7D&amp;t=529</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SQ74nt3ynw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/uKXSZyrIOeU?t=1168\">https://youtu.be/uKXSZyrIOeU?t=1168</a>\n</p><p>For AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zaswZfIEibA?t=984\">https://youtu.be/zaswZfIEibA?t=984</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/uhpWASWW2ns\">https://youtu.be/uhpWASWW2ns</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=782s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=782s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_MaffyTaffy\">Video solution by MaffyTaffy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by MaffyTaffy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xCxm5avCEHY\">https://youtu.be/xCxm5avCEHY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A\">2024 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2024 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AM